      "dateCreated": "2026-09-07T06:22:49.906Z",
      "dateModified": "2026-09-07T06:22:49.906Z",
      "description": "The synthetic dataset has mean germination of 79% for control and 87% for primed, with n = 3 replicates per group; primed minus control is 8 percentage points. A separate notebook recomputed the values and verified the input SHA256. These results support only this synthetic publication and provenance demonstration; no biological inference is made.",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "urn:uuid:70f02f8f-0be8-4830-886e-2bbc78845c4e"
      },
      "keywords": ["synthetic"],
      "name": "Synthetic group means differ by 8 percentage points",
      "text": "The synthetic dataset has mean germination of 79% for control and 87% for primed, with n = 3 replicates per group; primed minus control is 8 percentage points. A separate notebook recomputed the values and verified the input SHA256. These results support only this synthetic publication and provenance demonstration; no biological inference is made.",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:f328cf00-80f5-4dcb-9e60-c37cae858339",
