      "text": "A separate delegated notebook (00f99b5c-99d6-4089-91db-e48628a761ad; successful run 336a4362-a00b-4a21-abd6-a849d30df8dd, exit code 0, outputArtifact null) recomputed control percentages [78, 80, 79] and primed percentages [86, 88, 87], means 79% and 87%, an 8 percentage point difference, and n = 3 in each group. All numerical assertions passed. The input digest matched sha256:7c22c618bbd87c92777e76625a8e2225b10d30adfe4823ffdb986bd2bfd63838. The figure notebook executed the supplied code successfully and registered germination.png with code and input provenance. This evidence supports the synthetic demonstration result only; no biological inference is made.",
